  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "First, let's try the game using <b>Play Mode</b>! You can select Play in the <b>Toolbar</b> at the top of this layout.\n\nGo deeper:\n\n\u2022 The <b>Scene view</b> (in the center of this layout) is where you\u2019ll manipulate and change things.\n\n\u2022 When you enter Play Mode, the Scene view changes into the <b>Game view</b> for testing."
--- !u!114 &2456875452084768247
