    m_Untranslated: 'Let''s test the new gravity! To jump, use the <b>space bar.</b>


      Before testing, remember to save your changes:


      In the top menu, go to <b>File</b> > <b>Save</b>, or use the shortcut <b>Ctrl</b> / <b>Cmd</b> + <b>S</b>.'
